WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,560 --> 00:00:01,110
stop

2
00:00:01,160 --> 00:00:27,980
I surrender

3
00:00:27,980 --> 00:00:30,180
The alarm is in the bag on my right thigh

4
00:00:30,580 --> 00:00:40,830
